# Markdown images

When embedding screenshots or demo images in Markdown (README, docs, changelogs):

- Prefer `width="30%"` on `<img>` tags
- Do **not** use fixed pixel widths like `width="220"`

Example:

```html
<img src="..." width="30%" alt="...">
```
